  "item_short_desc": "<p>Upgrade your wardrobe with Rothco's Long Sleeve Digital Camo T-Shirt, a perfect blend of comfort and durability. Crafted from a high-quality 60% cotton/40% polyester material, this long-sleeve shirt offers a soft feel against your skin. Conveniently machine washable, this shirt maintains its vibrant colors and shape after every wash. Experience enhanced comfort with the tagless label design, preventing irritation. Choose from a variety of digital camo patterns to express your individuality.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "40460",
  "description": "<p>Upgrade your wardrobe with Rothco's Long Sleeve Digital Camo T-Shirt, a perfect blend of comfort and durability. Crafted from a high-quality 60% cotton/40% polyester material, this long-sleeve shirt offers a soft feel against your skin. Conveniently machine washable, this shirt maintains its vibrant colors and shape after every wash. Experience enhanced comfort with the tagless label design, preventing irritation. Choose from a variety of digital camo patterns to express your individuality. Rothco's Long Sleeve Digital Camo T-Shirt is more than clothing; it's a statement of style and quality. Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and active-duty personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>",
